# Pose move: the firmware solves the IK and walks its own S-curve (SDK Arm::move_p).
#
# pose is [x, y, z, roll, pitch, yaw]. wait=false returns as soon as the firmware has
# accepted the plan; poll_cart reports the outcome. Refused unless allow_motion:=true.

float64[6] pose
float64 speed
bool wait
---
bool success
string message
